WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.767
President Vladimir

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.135
Putin is accusing the Wagner

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:04.571
mercenary group of an armed rebellion.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.539
And he warns that those involved

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.341
will be punished.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.576
The head of the volunteer

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.310
group Yevgeny

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:10.977
Prigozhin,

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:13.813
says his forces have taken control of

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:14.748
excuse me,

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.149
Russian military facilities

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.051
in the region of Rostov on Don.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.053
He threatens to move on to Moscow

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.888
so if Russia's top general

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.457
and defense minister don't meet him

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.328
you should ask him.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.163
This would be open again.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.531
We came here.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.532
We want to receive

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.067
the chief of general staff.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:35.602
And so we go

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.270
until they aren't here

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.571
and so they aren't here.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.240
We will be located here

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.275
blockading the city of Rostov

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.944
and will go to Moscow.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.112
President Putin calls

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:46.713
the actions

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.514
by Prigozhin

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:48.648
a betrayal

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.983
and a stab in the back

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:50.917
to the Russian people.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.952
And he says those who follow him

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.421
will pay the price

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.158
for all those who deliberately

00:00:58.158 --> 00:00:59.692
chose the path of treachery,

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.160
who prepared

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.361
an armed mutiny,

00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:02.962
who chose the path of blackmail

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:03.930
and terrorist methods.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.865
Will face inevitable punishment.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.300
And we'll answer both to the law

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.235
and to our people.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.770
We're following all of the developments

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:11.871
on what's happening in Russia

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.273
with our reporters and analysts

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.574
around the world this morning.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.442
So let's start there

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:15.942
with the latest

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:18.044
on what's happening in Russia right now.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:18.745
CNN chief

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.646
international security

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:20.513
correspondent Nick

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.581
Paton Walsh is

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.383
tracking the developments for us.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.052
What is happening right now

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:27.720
We've never seen anything like this

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.988
in Putin's Russia before.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.857
Quite unprecedented territory,

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.125
a direct threat

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:34.360
to his grip on power for 23 years.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:35.462
Now, at this stage,

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:36.963
we are checking to see

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.798
if the Wagner forces you heard about

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.767
that are in Rostov, seen on the streets.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.202
They're casually relaxed around

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:42.969
key buildings.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.138
Remember, this is a military hub

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:46.773
for the Russian war

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.640
in Ukraine

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.043
and forces across that southern region

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:51.578
to see if these forces

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:52.178
are indeed

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.513
trying to move, as they say,

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.482
they are in the direction of Moscow.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:56.616
There are suggestions

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.318
from some of their supporters

00:01:58.318 --> 00:01:58.685
that they may

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:00.386
have got into the city of Orange,

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.522
kind of half way on the highway up

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.557
towards Moscow. That is not confirmed.

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:06.126
And indeed denied

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.661
by Kremlin backed officials in that area.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.163
But at the same time, too,

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.965
the governor of Orange has said

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.199
that combat measures

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.300
by the Russian military

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.368
have indeed begun.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.603
That would be a suggestion

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:17.570
that the Russian military

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.606
are indeed taking on Volga now.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:20.440
Now, it's unclear

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.308
the size of the bargaining force

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.143
that has moved,

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:25.011
but this all began on Friday

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.746
with an extraordinary series

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:27.981
of statements

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:29.249
by their leader, Yevgeny

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:30.350
Prigozhin, essentially

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.452
taking issue with the entire cause

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:34.454
of Russia's war in Ukraine.

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.688
Saying that essentially Russians

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:36.489
had been deceived

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.458
and there wasn't a threat from NATO's.

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.593
Russians were not being persecuted.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:41.694
That was suddenly,

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.197
it seemed, responded to by a claims

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:46.533
of an airstrike against a park in a camp

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.835
probably inside of Ukraine.

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:49.636
That's been denied

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.037
by the Russian Ministry of Defense,

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.172
but has put into place

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.373
this extraordinary

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.775
series of events of volcanic forces,

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:58.378
it seems, being taken from Ukraine

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:01.381
and marching on a Russian military

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:02.682
hub, Rostov on Don.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:04.517
And now it seems heading further.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.885
And the important thing to note

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:07.287
here is while perhaps Yevgeny

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:08.888
progression may have begun,

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:09.589
all of this

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:11.791
as a bid to take on the top brass

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:12.692
of Russia's military,

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:14.460
the defense minister Sergei Shoigu,

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.929
and some of the chief of staff

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.730
now running that operation.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.198
It's now

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.500
clearly him against Vladimir Putin.

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.901
He's been utterly clear

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.403
in his most recent statement

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.405
that he thinks the president is mistaken

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:27.073
to suggest this is a betrayal.

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:28.541
And Putin was very clear

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:30.109
that those who are now behind

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.644
this insurrection have chosen

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:32.812
the path of blackmail.

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.147
And terrorist methods

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:36.282
and will face inevitable punishment.

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.817
A suggestion in that speech from Putin,

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:39.085
if you want to lay your arms down,

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.386
there might be some sucker.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.155
But frankly, straight up here,

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:42.889
he was saying,

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:44.023
we're going to put this down.

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.625
The question is, can he

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:47.227
and how long does this go on for?

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:48.494
Every hour,

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.330
essentially calls into question

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.265
Putin's control of Russia

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:53.733
and more importantly, possibly,

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:54.500
too, for the world,

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.135
quite how the war in Ukraine

00:03:56.135 --> 00:03:58.438
will play out in the hours ahead.

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:00.273
Yeah, Nick, authoritarianism

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:02.041
or if this is now progressed

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:03.376
a totalitarian

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:05.111
totalitarianism does not allow

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:08.147
for this type of confrontation either

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:09.716
rhetorically or militarily.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.751
So what potentially is next?

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:14.354
Are we talking potential civil war?

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:17.991
You say this is now prigozhin v Putin.

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:19.592
Is this a coup attempt?

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.094
How would you frame this

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.763
Look, this has become

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:24.964
prigozhin versus Putin.

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:25.832
There's no doubt about it.

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:26.366
After speech,

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:27.600
we heard from Putin

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.402
and the response from Prigozhin.

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:30.803
I think it would be naive, frankly,

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:31.404
for what goes into

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:32.572
to think he could do something like this

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.306
and will essentially echo

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:34.507
the wrath of the Kremlin head

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:35.275
and have that taken out

00:04:35.275 --> 00:04:35.942
instead on the top

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.443
brass of Russia's military.

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:38.611
Where do we go from now?

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.646
Well, it comes down to really

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:40.647
how much of Russia's

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:41.781
beleaguered military,

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:42.682
the special forces

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:43.750
decimated after this

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.018
ghastly war in Ukraine,

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:46.519
where the frankly, mismanagement

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:47.220
has been in evidence

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.688
from the very first days,

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:50.256
was supposed to take three days.

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:50.823
Now, here we are

00:04:50.823 --> 00:04:51.991
six months in

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.092
and they're still laboring

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:54.861
to try and hold parts of territory.

00:04:54.861 --> 00:04:55.595
It depends

00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:56.996
what's left of the Russian

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:58.931
military to defend Putin.

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:00.566
Do the Special Forces

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:01.901
of the FSB, Russia's

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:03.503
security services, feel

00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:05.471
they want to turn their guns on Prigozhin

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.473
and the men around him of fighters

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:09.842
who've lost thousands of colleagues

00:05:09.842 --> 00:05:11.010
in the fight for Baku

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.111
to put themselves up

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:13.346
as the storied heroes

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:14.080
that brutal fighters,

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.048
make no mistake about it.

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:17.116
But the storied heroes of Russia's

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:18.751
frontline activity

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:20.053
are the Russian military willing

00:05:20.053 --> 00:05:21.587
to turn their guns upon them,

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:23.056
or are we going to see Vadim

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:24.090
as it moves,

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.992
amassing more strength

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:27.126
from Russia's military

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:28.461
as it heads towards Moscow?

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:29.062
I can't believe,

00:05:29.062 --> 00:05:30.430
frankly, I'm even saying

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.398
this unprecedented territory.

00:05:32.398 --> 00:05:33.866
And I think it goes to show

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:35.635
when you get behind the curtain

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.403
of exactly what's happening in Putin's

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:38.371
Russia, about which we know

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:40.073
so little finally,

00:05:40.073 --> 00:05:41.374
when sunlight shines upon it,

00:05:41.374 --> 00:05:42.875
it is an utterly startling

00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:43.776
picture of betrayal

00:05:43.776 --> 00:05:45.645
we're seeing here and utter chaos

00:05:45.645 --> 00:05:46.546
and a man at the top

00:05:46.546 --> 00:05:47.880
who's clearly not in control.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.082
Yeah, an extraordinary

00:05:49.082 --> 00:05:51.084
turn of events and a big question

00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:53.019
as to what this means for Putin

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:54.153
and the future of Russia.

00:05:54.153 --> 00:05:55.788
Nick Paton Walsh, thank you very much.

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:57.090
Just go now to CNN's

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:58.858
senior international correspondent

00:05:58.858 --> 00:05:59.892
Frederik Pleitgen.

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:00.360
Fred,

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.195
tell us more about Yevgeny

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:04.197
Prigozhin, who rose to prominence

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:06.866
as a close ally of Vladimir Putin for

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.601
for many, many years.

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:11.304
He was one of his wealthy oligarchs

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:11.904
and then turned into

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:14.173
this very effective leader

00:06:14.173 --> 00:06:15.675
of a private military group.

00:06:15.675 --> 00:06:17.243
And now he's challenging

00:06:17.243 --> 00:06:18.644
Putin's grip on power

00:06:21.314 --> 00:06:23.483
as the leader of of a whole empire,

00:06:23.483 --> 00:06:24.450
if you will, Amara.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.852
It really is a rise

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:29.021
that is also unprecedented inside Russia,

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:30.390
but certainly one that also speaks

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:32.291
to how Vladimir Putin controls

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:32.759
the country.

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:34.260
We have to keep in mind that Yevgeny

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.061
Prigozhin

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:36.763
is still known to many people

00:06:36.763 --> 00:06:38.664
as being Putin's caterer.

00:06:38.664 --> 00:06:39.732
Or Putin's chef

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:41.868
because he ran a catering service

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:43.069
that apparently also catered

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:44.303
to Vladimir Putin as well,

00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:45.304
and then became closer

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:47.106
and closer to the Russian president

00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:47.607
and started

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:49.175
building this big empire,

00:06:49.175 --> 00:06:50.777
which, of course, also includes

00:06:50.777 --> 00:06:52.512
propaganda institutions.

00:06:52.512 --> 00:06:54.414
The Internet Research Agency, of course,

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:55.982
which is known for having meddled

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:56.416
the U.S.

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.384
says in the 2016 election

00:06:58.384 --> 00:06:58.918
Yevgeny

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:00.686
Prigozhin is one of the individuals

00:07:00.686 --> 00:07:02.922
who was sanctioned by the U.S.

00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:05.391
for meddling in the 2016 election.

00:07:05.558 --> 00:07:07.093
But he then built that empire

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:08.795
including the Viognier private

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:09.862
military company.

00:07:09.862 --> 00:07:10.696
He is of course

00:07:10.696 --> 00:07:11.597
the head of the Wagner

00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:12.632
private military company.

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:13.366
And it's one of those things

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:15.868
where we've seen that

00:07:16.502 --> 00:07:18.971
that company rise meteoric.

00:07:18.971 --> 00:07:20.673
Lee really over the past couple of years

00:07:20.673 --> 00:07:24.477
I was in Syria in I think 2014 or 2015.

00:07:24.477 --> 00:07:26.012
When we first saw Wagner

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:27.380
appear on the scene there,

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.414
they were essentially doing

00:07:28.414 --> 00:07:29.482
base protection,

00:07:29.482 --> 00:07:30.049
some of the things that

00:07:30.049 --> 00:07:31.684
private military companies do,

00:07:31.684 --> 00:07:33.719
but then continuously got involved

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:34.854
in the fight as well.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:36.189
He then branched out

00:07:36.189 --> 00:07:37.690
into the oil business

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.691
for the oil fields

00:07:38.691 --> 00:07:39.692
that the Assad regime

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:40.793
had taken back,

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:42.061
essentially taking control of those,

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:44.030
getting a cut of that as well,

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.565
and then moved operations

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:47.533
also into Africa and built

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:48.768
an empire there,

00:07:48.768 --> 00:07:50.770
training African forces,

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:51.337
for instance,

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:53.072
with his private military company.

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:53.673
But then also,

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:54.874
of course, getting into the gold

00:07:54.874 --> 00:07:57.310
diamond trade as well, running mines

00:07:57.543 --> 00:07:58.377
and the like.

00:07:58.377 --> 00:07:59.846
So he certainly became

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:00.580
a force

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.781
globally and someone

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:03.249
whose global reach continued.

00:08:03.249 --> 00:08:05.384
And then if we look at Ukraine,

00:08:05.384 --> 00:08:07.253
that is where I would say this turned

00:08:07.253 --> 00:08:09.422
from being a private military company

00:08:09.422 --> 00:08:10.389
that does security

00:08:10.389 --> 00:08:11.791
and maybe some training

00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:12.892
into what we see now,

00:08:12.892 --> 00:08:14.460
which is a full fledged army.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.061
In fact,

00:08:15.061 --> 00:08:17.897
Yevgeny Prigozhin himself calls Wagner

00:08:17.997 --> 00:08:20.700
the most powerful army in Russia.

00:08:20.733 --> 00:08:21.133
He calls it

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:22.401
one of the most powerful armies

00:08:22.401 --> 00:08:24.136
in the world, quite frankly.

00:08:24.136 --> 00:08:25.605
And a lot of what Nick

00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:27.173
was talking about before

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:28.808
certainly was a catalyst for that,

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:30.743
which is the battle of Bermuda,

00:08:30.743 --> 00:08:32.745
which was obviously extremely brutal,

00:08:32.745 --> 00:08:34.847
where he started using these tactics

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:37.083
of taking prisoners from Russian prisons

00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:38.751
and then bringing them to the front lines

00:08:38.751 --> 00:08:40.686
to charge at Russian positions.

00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:42.421
I was in a bad mood

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:43.956
for when some of that was going on.

00:08:43.956 --> 00:08:45.758
And we had Ukrainians who were telling us

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:46.726
that there were just

00:08:46.726 --> 00:08:48.027
dozens and dozens

00:08:48.027 --> 00:08:49.762
of volunteer mercenaries

00:08:49.762 --> 00:08:51.330
who kept charging their positions

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:51.898
all the time.

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:53.065
And it was very difficult

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:54.300
for them to hold the line.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.735
However, he's claims

00:08:55.735 --> 00:08:57.169
that he had success in Bakhmut

00:08:57.169 --> 00:08:58.638
and he rubbed that in the face

00:08:58.638 --> 00:09:00.106
of the defense ministry,

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:00.873
obviously claiming

00:09:00.873 --> 00:09:01.474
that he was better

00:09:01.474 --> 00:09:02.441
than the defense minister.

00:09:02.441 --> 00:09:04.377
And now we see that full on feud

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:05.111
out in the open.

